<Shell>
  <h1>Your locality buys together. Everyone pays less.</h1>
  <p>Lotmates is group buying for neighbourhoods: an apartment block, a street, a colony or a whole locality. Neighbours book the same service together and the price drops for everyone as more homes join.</p>
  <h2>How it works</h2>
  <p>Each price step is a house. Every booking raises the water, and when a house fills the whole locality moves to the next price. Everyone pays the first price through Razorpay. When the deal closes, the difference goes back to the card or UPI you paid with. If too few homes book, everyone gets all of it back.</p>
  <p><a href="/deals">See live deals</a> · <a href="/legal">Policies</a> · <a href="/contact">Contact</a></p>
</Shell>
